{
  "slug": "codixing",
  "name": "Codixing",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Code retrieval engine that gives Claude structural understanding of your codebase. Before  modifying code, Codixing tells Claude what will break, predicting impact across the  dependency graph, finding affected tests, and tracing callers through the call hierarchy. Unlike text search,  Codixing builds an AST-aware index with BM25 + semantic hybrid retrieval, dependency graphs with PageRank ranking, and trigram-accelerated grep; all running locally with zero cloud dependencies.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `codixing-explore` (Deep codebase exploration using Codixing), `codixing-preflight` (MANDATORY before proposing new features, modules, or tools — and before claiming accuracy or performance numbers), `codixing-release` (Complete Codixing release pipeline — transactional version bump, tests, docs, CI review, benchmark, blog, X post, tag, publish), `codixing-review` (Code review with full context using Codixing), `codixing-setup` (Set up Codixing code retrieval engine for the current project)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `codixing`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install codixing@claude-community` from `ferax564/codixing` (`claude-plugin`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 5,
    "mcp": 1
  },
